  "name" : "Queralt2006 - Initiation of mitotic exit by downregulation of PP2A in budding yeast",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">     <p>Mathematical model of mitotic exit in budding yeast.</p>  </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
